<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cemig debentures to be auctioned April 25.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cemig debentures to be auctioned April 25.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BNDESpar, the investment arm of Brazil's National Development Bank, is selling debentures convertible into Minas Gerais state power firm Cemig common shares at an auction April 25, a BNDESpar official said.</p>
<p>A total of 18.7 million debentures convertible into a 32.9 percent voting stake in Cemig will be auctioned in a block sale for a minimum price of 60.37 reais per debenture to a strategic partner.</p>
</text>
